## SQ-SPFX-06 | dict validators clean
@group A
@commands full pack boot: `grep -A30 "\[item_dict\] Missing\|\[block_dict\] Missing\|\[fluid_dict\] Missing" logs/latest.log`; `grep -c "is not validated" logs/latest.log`; `grep "tag entries not checked" logs/latest.log`
@pass no `Missing/invalid` list from any of the three dicts (or only ids whose mod is loaded and that a writeup expects); 0 `is not validated` lines; one `[block_dict] N tag entries not checked` and one `[fluid_dict] ...` info line
@fails a dict id whose item is gone (remove it, and its uses); the validators' `global.has` / glob skip
@from batches/r1106spfx/a1.qb
bootreject \[(item|block|fluid)_dict\] Missing
bootreject is not validated
shell grep -A30 "\[item_dict\] Missing\|\[block_dict\] Missing\|\[fluid_dict\] Missing" logs/latest.log | head -40; echo "notvalidated=$(grep -c 'is not validated' logs/latest.log)"; grep "tag entries not checked" logs/latest.log | head
look one [block_dict] and one [fluid_dict] 'tag entries not checked' info line, nothing else

## SQ-SPFX-07 | sky island generates
@group B (fresh world)
@commands `> locate structure creativeworldgen:sky_island` (Async Locator: waitlog); tp a creative bot there; `/zq under` is not meaningful (floating): `> execute at qa run zq count ~-40 100 ~-40 ~40 250 ~40 minecraft:grass_block` with literal coordinates from the locate; `shell grep -n "sky_island" kubejs/generation_scripts/worldgen/structure_tag_report.md` after the world load writes it
@pass locate finds one within about 2000 blocks (group `sky`, 0.22 of its slots); grass blocks at 135-165 above the ground at that spot; the report lists the island in `group/sky`
@fails `structure_set/sky_island.json` missing from the jar, or `type/sky` tag / `structure_groups.json` member not read (structure_overrides.js log)
@reviewed 2026-11-16
@from batches/r1106spfx/b1.qb
bootexpect Done \(
> pbot spawn qa 0 200 0 minecraft:overworld creative
> locate structure creativeworldgen:sky_island
waitlog (nearest|Could not find).*sky_island 300
capture P is at \[(-?\d+), (~|-?\d+), (-?\d+)\]
> tp qa {P1} 200 {P3}
sleep 25
# a count box is at most 262144 blocks (64x64x64): each box runs as slices; the shell sums them (island band y 100-250 first, must hold grass; then the ground band, for the record)
> say SPFX07HIGH begin
> cdevtest count {P1-40} 100 {P3-40} {P1+40} 250 {P3-20} minecraft:grass_block
> cdevtest count {P1-40} 100 {P3-19} {P1+40} 250 {P3+1} minecraft:grass_block
> cdevtest count {P1-40} 100 {P3+2} {P1+40} 250 {P3+22} minecraft:grass_block
> cdevtest count {P1-40} 100 {P3+23} {P1+40} 250 {P3+40} minecraft:grass_block
> say SPFX07HIGH end
waitlog SPFX07HIGH end 120
shell python3 -I -c "import re,sys;L=open('logs/latest.log',errors='replace').read().splitlines();a=sys.argv[1];i=max([k for k,l in enumerate(L) if a+' begin' in l]+[0]);t={};[t.__setitem__(m[1],t.get(m[1],0)+int(m[2])) for l in L[i:] for m in [re.search(r'verb=count block=(\S+) n=(\d+)',l)] if m];s=sum(int(m[1]) for l in L[i:] for m in [re.search(r'verb=count .*skipped_columns=(\d+)',l)] if m);print(a,'totals',t,'skipped_columns',s);z=[b for b in sys.argv[2:] if not t.get(b)];print('zero:',z);sys.exit(1 if z else 0)" SPFX07HIGH minecraft:grass_block
> say SPFX07LOW begin
> cdevtest count {P1-40} 0 {P3-40} {P1+40} 99 {P3-14} minecraft:grass_block
> cdevtest count {P1-40} 0 {P3-13} {P1+40} 99 {P3+13} minecraft:grass_block
> cdevtest count {P1-40} 0 {P3+14} {P1+40} 99 {P3+40} minecraft:grass_block
> say SPFX07LOW end
waitlog SPFX07LOW end 120
shell python3 -I -c "import re,sys;L=open('logs/latest.log',errors='replace').read().splitlines();a=sys.argv[1];i=max([k for k,l in enumerate(L) if a+' begin' in l]+[0]);t={};[t.__setitem__(m[1],t.get(m[1],0)+int(m[2])) for l in L[i:] for m in [re.search(r'verb=count block=(\S+) n=(\d+)',l)] if m];s=sum(int(m[1]) for l in L[i:] for m in [re.search(r'verb=count .*skipped_columns=(\d+)',l)] if m);print(a,'totals',t,'skipped_columns',s);z=[b for b in sys.argv[2:] if not t.get(b)];print('zero:',z);sys.exit(1 if z else 0)" SPFX07LOW
reject \[cdevtest\] .*done=0
shell sleep 5; grep -n "sky_island" $INST/kubejs/generation_scripts/worldgen/structure_tag_report.md | head -5; grep -n "sky_island" logs/latest.log | head -5
look locate within ~2000 blocks; grass between y100-250 at the spot; report lists it under group/sky

